  538: 6. **Bring the Phase 0ƒ?"3 evidence onto the promotion candidate branch** (or
  539:    record an explicit owner-approved cross-branch citation base), so the line
  540:    being promoted actually carries the evidence it is promoted on. See A2.-1.
  541: 7. **Repair the frozen contract itself**: add Phase 0 rows for section 13
